          "title": "You'll want to know: बातूनी",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बातूनी — bātūnī — \"talkative\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मेरी मौसी बहुत बातूनी हैं, घंटों बात करती हैं। merī mausī bahut bātūnī haiṁ, ghaṇṭoṁ bāt kartī haiṁ. My aunt is very talkative; she talks for hours."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बातूनी (bātūnī) is bāt, \"talk\", with the ending -ūnī; CDIAL lists Hindi bāt, \"talk, matter, thing\", under Sanskrit vārtta (CDIAL 11564)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
